**The story:** A construction services firm, 18 months into their GSA Schedule, zero revenue. The audit revealed three silent killers: lapsed TAA cert, pricing drift on 3 line items, missed Option Period notice. After correcting all three, first RFQ accepted within 60 days.

**Why this angle:** Targets the under-discussed "Schedule holder with no wins" segment — readers who think their problem is marketing when it's actually compliance. Designed to drive comments from practitioners sharing their own compliance catch stories.

